        "suggestion": "Change pub mode: String to pub mode: OperationMode in ArchitectureInfo. OperationMode already implements Serialize/Deserialize with rename_all = snake_case, so existing JSON checkpoints with 'simple' or 'physics' strings will deserialize correctly.",
