        "related_files": [
          "src/neurons/lif/mode.rs",
          "src/hardware.rs",
          "src/spice.rs",
          "src/config.rs"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "PhysicsParams has tau_m: f32 (seconds), v_peak: f32 (volts), tau_theta: f32 (seconds), v_min: f32 (volts) \u2014 all raw f32. CircuitConfig has c_mem: f32 (farads), r_leak: f32 (ohms), vdd: f32 (volts), dt: f32 (seconds). A call like compute_membrane_with_dt(mem, input, Some(tau_pulse)) would compile fine but be physically wrong."
